{
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "Send new Spitogatos.gr property listings with agent phones to Google Sheets and Telegram with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -760,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 1100,
        "content": "## Send new Spitogatos.gr property listings with agent phones to Google Sheets and Telegram\n\nEvery morning this workflow checks Spitogatos.gr, Greece's largest property portal, for listings published in the last 24 hours in the areas you pick. Each new listing is saved to Google Sheets with its price per m\u00b2, floor, year built and the agent's name and phone number, and a summary is sent to Telegram.\n\n\u039d\u03ad\u03b5\u03c2 \u03b1\u03b3\u03b3\u03b5\u03bb\u03af\u03b5\u03c2 \u03b1\u03ba\u03b9\u03bd\u03ae\u03c4\u03c9\u03bd \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf Spitogatos.gr \u03bc\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bb\u03ad\u03c6\u03c9\u03bd\u03bf \u03bc\u03b5\u03c3\u03af\u03c4\u03b7, \u03ba\u03ac\u03b8\u03b5 \u03c0\u03c1\u03c9\u03af \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf Telegram.\n\n### Who it's for\nProperty investors, buyers relocating to Greece, and agents who watch a neighbourhood.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Schedule** runs the workflow every morning at 8:00.\n2. **Set your search** holds your areas, budget, size and deal settings.\n3. **Apify** runs the [Spitogatos.gr Scraper](https://apify.com/fayoussef/spitogatos-scraper?fpr=youssef) for listings first posted in the last 24 hours.\n4. **Remove Duplicates** drops listings you already received.\n5. Every new listing is saved to your Google Sheet.\n6. Matching listings go to Telegram in one message.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com/?fpr=youssef) and connect it in the **Apify** node (OAuth or API token).\n2. Create an empty Google Sheet and paste its URL in **Set your search**.\n3. Create a Telegram bot with @BotFather, connect it, and paste your chat id in **Set your search**.\n4. Edit the areas and filters, run once, then activate.\n\n### Requirements\n- Apify account (the free plan works)\n- Google Sheets and a Telegram bot\n\n### How to customize\n- Set `maxPricePerM2` (for example 2500) to alert only on listings under that price per m\u00b2.\n- Use `rent` in `listingType` to track rentals.\n- Add more areas, in English or Greek, separated by commas."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -200,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "### 1. Set your search\n`locations`: area names in English or Greek, separated by commas (for example `Kolonaki, Pangrati`).\n`listingType`: `sale` or `rent`.\n`propertyType`: `apartment`, `studio`, `maisonette`, `detached`, `villa` or empty for all homes.\n`maxPricePerM2`: 0 sends every new listing. Set a number to get only listings under it, plus price cuts when `alertOnPriceCuts` is true."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        360,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "### 2. Find new listings\nRuns the [Spitogatos.gr Scraper](https://apify.com/fayoussef/spitogatos-scraper?fpr=youssef) on your Apify account for listings first posted within `postedWithin`. `maxPages` keeps each run small.\n\n**Skip listings already sent** remembers every listing id across runs, so you never see the same home twice.\n\nUsage is billed per listing on your Apify account."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        920,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 920,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "### 3. Save and alert\nEvery new listing becomes one row in your Google Sheet with the agent's phone number (headers are created on the first run).\n\nMatching listings reach Telegram in one message with up to 20 homes. The rest are in the sheet."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -120,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Set your search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        120,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789001",
              "name": "locations",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Glyfada, Voula"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789002",
              "name": "listingType",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "sale"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789003",
              "name": "propertyType",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "apartment"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789004",
              "name": "priceMax",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 350000
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789005",
              "name": "areaMin",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 50
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789006",
              "name": "roomsMin",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789007",
              "name": "postedWithin",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "24hours"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789008",
              "name": "maxPages",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789009",
              "name": "maxPricePerM2",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789010",
              "name": "alertOnPriceCuts",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789011",
              "name": "googleSheetUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL_HERE"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789012",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID_HERE"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Find new listings on Spitogatos.gr",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "position": [
        460,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "actorId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "aAohRNwnunh3U1L6d"
        },
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "customBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(Object.entries({\n  start_urls: [],\n  locations: $json.locations.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n  listing_type: $json.listingType || 'sale',\n  category: 'residential',\n  property_types: $json.propertyType.trim() || null,\n  price_max: $json.priceMax || null,\n  area_min: $json.areaMin || null,\n  rooms_min: $json.roomsMin || null,\n  posted_within: $json.postedWithin || '24hours',\n  max_depth: $json.maxPages || 3\n}).filter(([k, v]) => v !== null))) }}",
        "actorSource": "store"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Skip listings already sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [
        720,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.id }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Format property row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        980,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "ignoreConversionErrors": true
        },
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789001",
              "name": "Price (EUR)",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.price) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789002",
              "name": "Area (m2)",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.sq_meters) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789003",
              "name": "EUR per m2",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(Number($json.pricePerSqMeters)) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789004",
              "name": "Rooms",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.rooms ?? '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789005",
              "name": "Floor",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ (f => f === '' ? '' : (isNaN(f) ? f : 'Floor ' + f))(String($json['Floor Level'] ?? $json.floorNumber ?? '')) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789006",
              "name": "Built",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.year_of_construction || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789007",
              "name": "Neighbourhood",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.geographiesByLevel_4_fullName || $json.geographiesByLevel_2_fullName || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789008",
              "name": "Region",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.geographiesByLevel_2_fullName || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789009",
              "name": "Price cut (%)",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.priceReduced) === 'True' || $json.priceReduced === true ? Number($json.priceChangePercentage) || '' : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789010",
              "name": "Agency",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.agency_name || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789011",
              "name": "Contact",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.contact_name || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789012",
              "name": "Phone",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.contact_telephone || $json.agency_telephone || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789013",
              "name": "First listed",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.firstPublishDate || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789014",
              "name": "Photo",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ Array.isArray($json.images) ? ($json.images[0] || '') : ((String($json.images || '').match(/https?:[^'\",\\]\\s]+/) || [''])[0]) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789015",
              "name": "Found on",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISODate() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b170a01f-+123456789016",
              "name": "Link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.url }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "5b170a01-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Save every listing to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1240,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "schema": [],
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gid=0"
